  "meta": {
    "name": "Enigma X Auth Design Tokens",
    "scope": "Enigma X web sign-in (hub/auth/enigma-signin.html) + mobile Authenticator (hub/auth/enigma-authenticator.html)",
    "source": "HTML prototypes (no Figma). Specs: enigma-x/auth-html-spec/web-signin.md, authenticator.md. Rule set: audit/BUILD_RULES.md section 11.",
    "mode": "light only (neither prototype ships a dark theme, prefers-color-scheme or prefers-reduced-motion)",
    "cssPrefix": "--eauth-",
    "classPrefixes": "web components .web-*, mobile .app-*, shared icons .eauth-icon / .eauth-i-*",
    "notes": "The prototypes define 15 (web) and 14 (app) --c-* variables and no other tokens; everything else here is extracted from literals with source line refs. \"web\" and \"app\" colour groups are kept separate because the same --c-* name has different values on each surface (text-2, text-3, border, danger, bg...). See prototypeVariables for the faithful --c-* map. Cross-system: the Enigma main trading app (Figma) uses Geist/Geist Mono with the same brand #7AEFEF; auth keeps DM Sans/DM Mono (owner decision 2026-10-14)."
  },
